WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:00:08.905 --> 00:00:10.475
[All characters, locations,
and events in this drama]

00:00:10.475 --> 00:00:11.997
[are fictional and not based
on real people or events.]

00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:13.085
[Production guidelines were followed
when filming children and animals.]

00:00:14.238 --> 00:00:16.705
So you're kind Heungbu,

00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:21.238
and swallows never abandon Heungbu.

00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:24.605
Not me.

00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:29.005
You caught me.

00:00:31.605 --> 00:00:34.172
You ran to me.

00:00:36.305 --> 00:00:38.372
So, save me.

00:00:40.972 --> 00:00:43.605
Protect me with your all.

00:00:48.672 --> 00:00:50.305
That's an order.

00:00:56.605 --> 00:00:58.238
Oh, dear.

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:15.538
Correct.

00:01:16.172 --> 00:01:18.672
This darn jade hair ornament

00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:21.572
belongs to His Highness.

00:01:24.381 --> 00:01:25.538
Well,

00:01:25.538 --> 00:01:27.772
we don't have time for this.

00:01:27.772 --> 00:01:30.872
We must inform His Majesty immediately.

00:01:50.805 --> 00:01:52.829
[Shot and unconscious for half a month,
he's left Yeongdeok and will reach Hanyang soon.]

00:02:00.805 --> 00:02:03.438
The Crown Prince is alive?

00:02:03.438 --> 00:02:05.338
How troublesome.

00:02:09.505 --> 00:02:10.838
Yeo Ri.

00:02:10.838 --> 00:02:14.238
Where is Chief Secretary now?

00:02:15.005 --> 00:02:18.005
Yum, delicious.

00:02:18.005 --> 00:02:19.005
Come here.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:23.138
- Enough eating. Come here now.
- Why are you acting this way?

00:02:25.533 --> 00:02:27.497
Jeez!

00:02:28.638 --> 00:02:30.172
What are you doing now?

00:02:30.172 --> 00:02:31.372
Do you know who I am? How dare...

00:02:31.372 --> 00:02:36.405
Neither of us is without blemish,
so just send that court lady away.

00:02:36.405 --> 00:02:38.038
How...

00:02:54.072 --> 00:02:56.905
You're saying you killed the Crown Prince?

00:02:56.905 --> 00:02:58.672
Would you believe me if I were you?

00:02:58.672 --> 00:03:00.972
You must believe me.

00:03:01.605 --> 00:03:04.938
My father is searching for the ransom
to offer in my stead.

00:03:04.938 --> 00:03:06.938
Why would you strike me when I've done nothing...

00:03:06.938 --> 00:03:09.272
As Prince Je Woon's fifth cousin
and maternal uncle,

00:03:09.272 --> 00:03:13.072
didn't you try to enthrone Prince Je Woon
instead of the Crown Prince?

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:19.372
What do you want?

00:03:19.372 --> 00:03:21.605
Place Prince Je Woon on the throne.

00:03:21.605 --> 00:03:23.773
And I will

00:03:23.773 --> 00:03:25.838
sit beside him.

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:27.972
What must I do?

00:03:28.605 --> 00:03:32.338
The Left Minister's daughter
tried to make Prince Je Woon?

00:03:32.338 --> 00:03:33.338
Yes.

00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:36.638
Since the Crown Prince still lives,
I've been ordered to clean up the mess.

00:03:36.638 --> 00:03:39.938
Your Majesty, what shall we do?

00:03:40.738 --> 00:03:43.372
Now I understand.

00:03:43.372 --> 00:03:45.805
- Then it makes sense.
- Pardon?

00:03:45.805 --> 00:03:50.638
Only grasp half the hand
offered by Left Minister's daughter.

00:03:50.638 --> 00:03:55.105
Prince Je Woon seems
destined to die by another's hand.

00:04:07.438 --> 00:04:09.505
Jeez.

00:04:12.205 --> 00:04:13.805
From what I see,

00:04:13.805 --> 00:04:17.105
he must have saved my leg

00:04:17.105 --> 00:04:18.672
to use me like this.

00:04:18.672 --> 00:04:21.305
There's no other explanation.

00:04:22.172 --> 00:04:24.105
Oh, my.

00:04:24.905 --> 00:04:26.505
Alright, again.

00:04:34.572 --> 00:04:35.938
Almost there, almost there.

00:04:35.938 --> 00:04:37.572
Good.

00:04:37.572 --> 00:04:40.221
Oh my.

00:04:40.221 --> 00:04:42.437
Jeez.

00:04:46.138 --> 00:04:49.605
Is he really asleep right now?

00:04:51.773 --> 00:04:54.749
Good grief.

00:06:21.705 --> 00:06:23.338
I'm sorry.

00:06:24.772 --> 00:06:29.472
Why did you foolishly grab that hot thing?

00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:31.272
How silly.

00:06:49.472 --> 00:06:51.038
Hey, you're not asleep, right?

00:06:51.038 --> 00:06:53.005
Wake up, hey.

00:06:57.272 --> 00:06:59.069
Aren't you Nolbu's wife?

00:06:59.069 --> 00:07:01.205
Swallow my foot.

00:07:04.438 --> 00:07:07.645
[Episode 4 The Swallow
Doesn't Just Repay Kindness]

00:08:05.838 --> 00:08:08.405
Did you sleep well?

00:08:08.405 --> 00:08:10.105
Yes.

00:08:13.245 --> 00:08:15.405
Are you feeling better?

00:08:15.405 --> 00:08:17.805
I guess I should stop by the doctor's.

00:08:17.805 --> 00:08:18.805
Are you feeling very unwell?

00:08:18.805 --> 00:08:19.838
Let me take a look.

00:08:19.838 --> 00:08:21.872
I tried to handle the treatment myself.

00:08:21.872 --> 00:08:23.505
Jeez.

00:08:29.105 --> 00:08:30.472
Thank you.

00:08:30.472 --> 00:08:32.072
Yes.

00:08:34.972 --> 00:08:37.272
Now, please take care of her hand.

00:08:37.272 --> 00:08:39.038
Yes, understood.

00:08:39.038 --> 00:08:40.238
Me?

00:08:40.238 --> 00:08:41.605
No, I'm fine.

00:08:41.605 --> 00:08:45.838
Fine? Your palm is all blistered like that.

00:08:46.905 --> 00:08:49.638
I'm fine.

00:08:49.638 --> 00:08:51.738
If you don't get treated, I won't either.

00:08:51.738 --> 00:08:54.272
Excuse me, undo this for me.

00:08:54.272 --> 00:08:55.572
Oh, alright.

00:08:55.572 --> 00:08:58.572
- Hurry up.
- Alright.

00:08:58.572 --> 00:09:00.272
Here.

00:09:00.272 --> 00:09:02.672
That stubbornness of yours...

00:09:06.038 --> 00:09:08.238
You should've done this sooner.

00:09:21.505 --> 00:09:23.838
Wake up soon.

00:09:23.838 --> 00:09:24.905
My lord.

00:09:24.905 --> 00:09:27.638
Courier Cha from the Hanyang
Merchant Group has arrived.

00:09:27.638 --> 00:09:29.572
Courier Cha?

00:09:29.572 --> 00:09:33.905
His Highness sent a letter?

00:09:33.905 --> 00:09:36.138
So he's alive.

00:09:36.138 --> 00:09:39.438
I clearly delivered it to Eunuch Yoon,
but since that day

00:09:39.438 --> 00:09:41.672
I haven't been able to contact Eunuch Yoon.

00:09:41.672 --> 00:09:43.538
The palace guards have no intention of moving,

00:09:43.538 --> 00:09:47.405
and my access to the palace
has even been restricted.

00:09:47.405 --> 00:09:51.005
Someone's trying to stop His Highness.

00:09:51.005 --> 00:09:53.172
Understood. I'll go myself.

00:09:53.172 --> 00:09:55.672
Shouldn't we first inform His Majesty?

00:09:55.672 --> 00:09:59.005
No one in the palace can be trusted now.

00:09:59.005 --> 00:10:02.672
I'll go quietly and bring His Majesty back myself.

00:10:07.505 --> 00:10:09.605
Young lady.

00:10:09.605 --> 00:10:11.338
Young lady!

00:10:11.338 --> 00:10:12.605
It's an emergency.

00:10:12.605 --> 00:10:14.638
Prince Je Woon has...

00:10:14.638 --> 00:10:16.305
What about him?

00:10:34.838 --> 00:10:39.638
A letter from His Highness
has been found at your residence.

00:10:39.638 --> 00:10:42.272
What reason did you have to hide the letter?

00:10:42.272 --> 00:10:44.405
That's what I want to ask.

00:10:44.405 --> 00:10:47.405
Why would a letter I've never seen

00:10:48.238 --> 00:10:50.205
appear in my residence?

00:10:50.205 --> 00:10:54.638
Are you saying you didn't know
His Highness was alive?

00:10:54.638 --> 00:10:57.038
I knew, and that's why

00:10:57.038 --> 00:10:59.705
I sent someone to rescue His Highness.

00:10:59.705 --> 00:11:01.538
How am I supposed to tell

00:11:01.538 --> 00:11:04.972
whether you sent someone to save His Highness

00:11:04.972 --> 00:11:06.772
or to harm him?

00:11:06.772 --> 00:11:11.205
Why would I ever want to harm His Highness?

00:11:14.738 --> 00:11:16.797
You are

00:11:16.797 --> 00:11:19.538
the late king's legitimate first son.

00:11:19.538 --> 00:11:23.738
If Queen Jangjeong had not been
falsely accused of adultery,

00:11:23.738 --> 00:11:27.705
and if the late king had not ordered that

00:11:27.705 --> 00:11:31.605
the throne never be passed to you,

00:11:31.605 --> 00:11:36.405
then you would rightfully
have ascended the throne.

00:11:36.405 --> 00:11:38.429
I've never

00:11:38.429 --> 00:11:40.172
entertained such thoughts.

00:11:40.172 --> 00:11:43.605
Would the Grand Queen Dowager think so?

00:11:44.538 --> 00:11:46.738
Absolutely not!

00:11:46.738 --> 00:11:49.705
If he had intended to assassinate His Highness,

00:11:49.705 --> 00:11:54.438
would he have sent the Left Guard Officer
who had served His Highness all his life?

00:11:55.372 --> 00:11:58.589
I'll go quietly and bring
His Highness back myself.

00:12:00.605 --> 00:12:02.238
Are you alright?

00:12:02.238 --> 00:12:05.805
Have you come to your senses?

00:12:05.805 --> 00:12:08.005
I'll go.

00:12:08.705 --> 00:12:13.038
If you go, the entire palace will know.

00:12:15.438 --> 00:12:20.005
That person is creating unfavorable
circumstances for you.

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:21.672
What have I done?

00:12:21.672 --> 00:12:24.305
You know that the Royal Guards face

00:12:24.305 --> 00:12:28.405
severe punishment if they fail to properly protect

00:12:28.405 --> 00:12:30.205
the Crown Prince, don't you?

00:12:30.205 --> 00:12:33.505
Sometimes, even death must be borne.

00:12:33.505 --> 00:12:35.229
Yet

00:12:35.229 --> 00:12:37.338
you've let

00:12:37.338 --> 00:12:40.805
such a traitor escape.

00:12:53.138 --> 00:12:55.738
If it's for Prince Je Woon's sake, turn back.

00:12:55.738 --> 00:12:57.805
Nothing will change.

00:12:57.805 --> 00:13:00.272
I've lost.

00:13:00.272 --> 00:13:02.238
But do you know this?

00:13:02.238 --> 00:13:04.701
Amateurs always

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:07.261
choose self-sacrifice.

00:13:07.261 --> 00:13:09.205
If even a single hair of Prince Je Woon is harmed,

00:13:09.205 --> 00:13:11.138
I'll rush to the Investigation Bureau.

00:13:11.138 --> 00:13:13.772
Do you think I'll leave you legs to run with?

00:13:13.772 --> 00:13:17.205
Even if you break them, I'll crawl there.

00:13:17.205 --> 00:13:19.572
So if you want to stop me,

00:13:19.572 --> 00:13:21.438
you'll have to break my neck first.

00:13:21.438 --> 00:13:23.872
Do you think I can't?

00:13:23.872 --> 00:13:25.438
Someone!

00:13:25.438 --> 00:13:27.072
Yes.

00:13:30.405 --> 00:13:31.472
Did you call for me?

00:13:31.472 --> 00:13:32.705
Confine Woo Hee to her room,

00:13:32.705 --> 00:13:36.038
and don't let her take a single step out
until the royal wedding.

00:13:36.038 --> 00:13:38.072
Father.

00:13:38.072 --> 00:13:40.238
My apologies, young lady.

00:13:45.005 --> 00:13:47.872
If anyone lays a hand on my body,

00:13:47.872 --> 00:13:50.305
I'll bite off my tongue and die.

00:14:12.905 --> 00:14:14.905
What now?

00:14:23.138 --> 00:14:24.738
Oh, dear.

00:14:25.872 --> 00:14:28.105
Let's see.

00:14:29.438 --> 00:14:31.072
It's him.

00:14:31.872 --> 00:14:34.738
My lord, please get down.

00:14:34.738 --> 00:14:36.372
Who are you?

00:14:36.372 --> 00:14:38.405
Who sent you?

00:14:39.605 --> 00:14:41.765
Since I've taken the money,

00:14:41.765 --> 00:14:44.005
shouldn't I honor my loyalty?

00:14:44.005 --> 00:14:45.572
What should we do, my lord?

00:14:45.572 --> 00:14:46.738
Get down.

00:14:46.738 --> 00:14:47.938
Pardon?

00:14:47.938 --> 00:14:49.838
It's dangerous to stay on the horse.

00:14:49.838 --> 00:14:50.938
Get down and look straight ahead.

00:14:50.938 --> 00:14:53.038
Don't look back under any circumstances.

00:14:54.072 --> 00:14:55.705
Yes.

00:15:06.172 --> 00:15:07.772
I'm down.

00:15:07.772 --> 00:15:09.705
What now, my lord?

00:15:15.138 --> 00:15:16.738
My lord.

00:15:19.972 --> 00:15:21.605
Jeez.

00:15:26.172 --> 00:15:28.029
How pathetic to see a man

00:15:28.029 --> 00:15:32.505
- cowardly backpedaling to save himself.
- Darn.

00:15:32.505 --> 00:15:33.605
Come here!

00:15:33.605 --> 00:15:36.505
Filth like you don't deserve to live.

00:15:36.505 --> 00:15:37.805
Exactly my point.

00:15:37.805 --> 00:15:39.405
Hand me that axe.

00:15:39.405 --> 00:15:43.438
The more you trust someone who betrays you,
the harder they'll strike, huh?

00:15:43.438 --> 00:15:45.738
I shouldn't have spared him. Never should've.

00:15:45.738 --> 00:15:48.205
Sun Tzu's Art of War states

00:15:48.205 --> 00:15:52.005
'Appear weak when you are strong.'

00:15:52.005 --> 00:15:56.238
But since I lack such skills,

00:15:56.238 --> 00:15:58.338
my strategy is this.

00:15:58.338 --> 00:16:00.538
What nonsense are you spouting now?

00:16:01.472 --> 00:16:03.472
Full frontal assault!

00:16:22.749 --> 00:16:24.805
Oh my!

00:17:15.505 --> 00:17:16.772
Are you alright?

00:17:16.772 --> 00:17:18.672
Yes.

00:17:18.672 --> 00:17:20.305
Here they are.

00:17:21.638 --> 00:17:23.372
What now?

00:17:38.772 --> 00:17:41.738
I'll distract them. Run.

00:17:51.172 --> 00:17:53.272
Stay alive this time.

00:17:55.272 --> 00:17:56.872
Please.

00:18:01.872 --> 00:18:03.505
My lord.

00:18:07.372 --> 00:18:10.205
I'm a woman who goes all in when I act!

00:18:10.205 --> 00:18:11.938
What? What?

00:18:31.138 --> 00:18:32.738
Oh, my.

00:18:44.305 --> 00:18:45.972
Oh, dear.

00:18:46.872 --> 00:18:48.472
Darn it.

00:18:49.938 --> 00:18:53.149
Hey! Come on!

00:18:53.785 --> 00:18:55.636
I kill you!

00:18:56.247 --> 00:18:57.373
Go die!

00:19:04.738 --> 00:19:06.338
Hey.

00:19:20.472 --> 00:19:22.105
Goodness.

00:19:24.472 --> 00:19:26.305
My lord.

00:19:26.305 --> 00:19:27.905
My lord.

00:19:28.538 --> 00:19:30.872
Jeez.

00:19:30.872 --> 00:19:32.538
God help us.

00:19:56.005 --> 00:19:57.605
Shin Won.

00:19:58.272 --> 00:20:00.138
My lord.

00:20:00.138 --> 00:20:02.138
I was wrong.

00:20:11.605 --> 00:20:13.105
You're alive.

00:20:13.105 --> 00:20:14.972
You survived.

00:20:18.705 --> 00:20:20.305
Thank you.

00:20:20.972 --> 00:20:23.905
Thank you for staying alive, Shin Won.

00:20:25.338 --> 00:20:26.338
Your Highness.

00:20:26.338 --> 00:20:28.838
More urgently, Prince Je Woon is in danger.

00:20:30.972 --> 00:20:32.872
Why Prince Je Woon?

00:20:34.138 --> 00:20:36.305
The Crown Prince is alive?

00:20:39.205 --> 00:20:41.373
The matter of Prince Je Woon can wait

00:20:41.373 --> 00:20:42.738
until after the Crown Prince returns...

00:20:42.738 --> 00:20:46.105
Are you certain His Highness will return?

00:20:46.105 --> 00:20:49.205
They tried to assassinate His Highness.

00:20:49.205 --> 00:20:54.738
What would people driven to the edge be afraid of?

00:20:55.472 --> 00:21:00.672
Do you truly believe Prince Je Woon
tried to murder the Crown Prince?

00:21:00.672 --> 00:21:04.972
The truth doesn't matter.

00:21:04.972 --> 00:21:08.605
What matters is that His Highness is alive,

00:21:08.605 --> 00:21:13.943
and that he must return safely.

00:21:13.943 --> 00:21:15.605
I mean His Highness the Crown Prince,

00:21:15.605 --> 00:21:18.685
whom Your Majesty protected

00:21:18.685 --> 00:21:21.172
by sacrificing all those he loves.

00:21:24.838 --> 00:21:27.172
Do as you wish.

00:21:28.872 --> 00:21:32.072
I obey your command, Your Majesty.

00:21:32.072 --> 00:21:34.138
The Left Minister's action means

00:21:34.138 --> 00:21:36.672
he has no intention of sparing Prince Je Woon.

00:21:36.672 --> 00:21:38.572
But the problem is that

00:21:38.572 --> 00:21:41.538
the Left Minister isn't the only one
who wants Je Woon dead.

00:21:41.538 --> 00:21:44.038
What do you mean by that?

00:21:47.072 --> 00:21:49.172
This actually works in our favor.

00:21:49.172 --> 00:21:50.909
There is neither

00:21:50.909 --> 00:21:54.172
the Crown Prince
nor Prince Je Woon with legitimate claim.

00:21:54.172 --> 00:21:59.205
If the king dies without an heir...

00:21:59.205 --> 00:22:02.138
The right to designate a successor
would fall to the Grand Queen Dowager.

00:22:02.138 --> 00:22:05.638
While Je Woon's exiled
and the Left Minister's distracted,

00:22:05.638 --> 00:22:07.705
they'll poison His Majesty.

00:22:07.705 --> 00:22:11.805
Her Majesty has never forgotten
the Gyesa Year incident.

00:22:11.805 --> 00:22:14.705
With the public watching,
even the Left Minister won't be able to

00:22:14.705 --> 00:22:16.305
exile Prince Je Woon outright.

00:22:16.305 --> 00:22:18.972
They'll eliminate Je Woon before I arrive.

00:22:18.972 --> 00:22:23.072
Within six or seven days of
reaching Hanyang from Yeongdeok.

00:22:23.072 --> 00:22:25.005
When did you send the letter?

00:22:25.005 --> 00:22:26.805
Today is the fifth day.

00:22:29.638 --> 00:22:31.472
Soon it will be the sixth.

00:22:31.472 --> 00:22:34.105
Even at full speed from now, two days remain.

00:22:34.105 --> 00:22:36.172
Your current condition
makes that impossible. Moreover...

00:22:36.172 --> 00:22:39.505
My men are lying in ambush along every land route

00:22:39.505 --> 00:22:42.138
from Yeongdeok to Hanyang.

00:22:42.138 --> 00:22:46.838
You'll never reach Hanyang.

00:22:46.838 --> 00:22:49.172
You still haven't come to your senses.

00:22:49.172 --> 00:22:52.305
Hey, the land routes are cut off,
are the waterways too?

00:22:52.305 --> 00:22:53.938
The sea route isn't blocked, is it?

00:22:53.938 --> 00:22:55.205
What do you mean?

00:22:55.205 --> 00:22:57.838
Is there any way to go by boat?

00:22:59.938 --> 00:23:02.072
Follow me.

00:23:03.072 --> 00:23:06.705
I've got an ace hidden nearby.

00:23:06.705 --> 00:23:09.505
[Segokseon]
I hate owing favors.

00:23:09.505 --> 00:23:11.638
Ah, no need.

00:23:11.638 --> 00:23:13.438
When did you...

00:23:13.438 --> 00:23:17.172
That porter once saved the ship officer's life.

00:23:17.172 --> 00:23:20.438
As a token of gratitude,
they'll set the ship afloat for us.

00:23:20.438 --> 00:23:23.605
We'll reach Mapo Port by morning.

00:23:27.005 --> 00:23:30.372
I've incurred a huge debt to that girl, Dal I.

00:23:30.372 --> 00:23:33.838
Will you be going to Hanyang with her?

00:23:34.455 --> 00:23:37.072
She's saved me countless times,

00:23:37.072 --> 00:23:38.472
so of course I should repay her.

00:23:38.472 --> 00:23:42.405
Can't the reward be sent separately to Boryeong?

00:23:42.405 --> 00:23:43.772
Hey.

00:23:43.772 --> 00:23:47.672
Would this ship sail without that girl?

00:23:50.905 --> 00:23:52.938
And gratitude

00:23:52.938 --> 00:23:55.405
isn't just about money, you understand?

00:23:58.072 --> 00:24:01.772
Why are you so heartless, Shin Won?

00:24:10.038 --> 00:24:11.872
Thank you.

00:24:19.205 --> 00:24:21.472
Do as Your Highness wishes.

00:24:26.405 --> 00:24:28.672
Did you laugh? You laughed at me?

00:24:28.672 --> 00:24:29.972
Need another beating, do you?

00:24:29.972 --> 00:24:31.072
No, it's not that

00:24:31.072 --> 00:24:32.805
I laughed, but now

00:24:32.805 --> 00:24:36.838
the night air is so cold I coughed,

00:24:36.838 --> 00:24:38.013
so that's all it was.

00:24:38.013 --> 00:24:40.572
You're misunderstanding.

00:24:40.572 --> 00:24:42.172
Hold on.

00:24:51.138 --> 00:24:53.053
Your coat

00:24:53.053 --> 00:24:55.738
looks good, huh?

00:24:55.738 --> 00:24:57.338
Pardon?

00:25:13.772 --> 00:25:17.672
If you glare at the river like that,
do you think the boat will go faster?

00:25:20.272 --> 00:25:21.805
Come sit.

00:25:21.805 --> 00:25:23.805
Let me change the dressings.

00:25:40.038 --> 00:25:42.238
Prince Je Woon faces treason charges.

00:25:42.238 --> 00:25:43.672
The Prince?

00:25:43.672 --> 00:25:45.972
Wait, hold on.

00:25:45.972 --> 00:25:47.672
If it's treason,

00:25:48.338 --> 00:25:49.805
doesn't that mean his life's in danger?

00:25:49.805 --> 00:25:52.005
I have to go.

00:25:52.005 --> 00:25:54.638
Because I'm the only one
who can save Prince Je Woon.

00:25:55.638 --> 00:25:57.238
But...

00:25:58.572 --> 00:26:01.705
I'm scared I'll be too late.

00:26:06.172 --> 00:26:08.372
You know that saying,

00:26:08.372 --> 00:26:10.172
- 'The more urgent it is...'
- 'Go back?'

00:26:10.172 --> 00:26:11.905
If it's urgent, why turn back?

00:26:11.905 --> 00:26:15.705
When things are urgent, double down on strategy!

00:26:55.038 --> 00:26:57.672
As soon as we reach Mapo Port,

00:26:57.672 --> 00:26:59.338
tie the bandages tight,

00:27:01.238 --> 00:27:03.005
brace yourselves,

00:27:04.938 --> 00:27:09.138
and go straight ahead, okay?

00:27:11.138 --> 00:27:12.672
Alright.

00:27:12.672 --> 00:27:15.172
If I go straight and have to turn back again,

00:27:15.172 --> 00:27:17.172
wait at the Hanyang Merchant Group.

00:27:17.172 --> 00:27:18.838
Don't fly off to Gangnam.

00:27:18.838 --> 00:27:20.205
Why suddenly mention Gangnam?

00:27:20.205 --> 00:27:21.838
You called yourself a swallow,

00:27:21.838 --> 00:27:23.838
but a swallow that leaves
Heungbu behind doesn't fly away.

00:27:23.838 --> 00:27:25.472
Ah.

00:27:26.805 --> 00:27:28.372
Just wait and see.

00:27:28.372 --> 00:27:30.505
The gourd is yours to take.

00:27:30.505 --> 00:27:32.705
That will be an enormous one.

00:27:32.705 --> 00:27:36.138
Don't get too startled when you see it.

00:27:36.138 --> 00:27:37.338
Don't worry.

00:27:37.338 --> 00:27:40.605
Me? I'm a woman with a liking
for material comforts.

00:27:52.372 --> 00:27:54.705
The moon's so beautiful tonight.

00:27:59.272 --> 00:28:01.105
It really is.

00:28:01.105 --> 00:28:05.005
Even though it's not full, it's pretty.

00:28:06.505 --> 00:28:11.605
♫ May there never be ♫

00:28:11.605 --> 00:28:17.105
♫ Not even once ♫

00:28:17.105 --> 00:28:25.772
♫ A season of sorrow or pain for you ♫

00:28:27.038 --> 00:28:32.205
♫ On sleepless nights ♫

00:28:32.205 --> 00:28:37.672
♫ May you never feel alone ♫

00:28:37.672 --> 00:28:45.021
♫ May you live carrying only good memories ♫

00:28:54.905 --> 00:28:56.738
My lord.

00:28:56.738 --> 00:28:58.972
I'll accompany you.

00:29:00.538 --> 00:29:02.172
My lord.

00:29:18.472 --> 00:29:21.705
My lord, who are you looking for?

00:29:21.705 --> 00:29:23.338
No one.

00:29:32.005 --> 00:29:33.372
Step aside.

00:29:33.372 --> 00:29:35.172
Before I slit my throat and die.

00:29:35.172 --> 00:29:36.572
What are you all doing?

00:29:36.572 --> 00:29:39.605
Don't you know our young lady
is someone who does what she says?

00:30:10.405 --> 00:30:12.938
[Mapo Fortress]

00:30:29.038 --> 00:30:31.005
Wow.

00:30:31.672 --> 00:30:34.705
It certainly wasn't
the kind of clothing like that.

00:30:43.705 --> 00:30:45.905
Wait at the Hanyang Merchant Group.

00:30:45.905 --> 00:30:47.505
Understood.

00:30:49.738 --> 00:30:52.372
Take care of yourself.

00:30:52.372 --> 00:30:54.105
Yes, I will.

00:30:59.472 --> 00:31:01.072
Let's go now.

00:31:05.138 --> 00:31:08.738
Did you see Prince Je Woon
being exiled in the marketplace earlier?

00:31:08.738 --> 00:31:11.472
They say he's being taken
to some island off Yeongdeok?

00:31:11.472 --> 00:31:15.638
I saw. Ugh, what a cruel fate.

00:31:15.638 --> 00:31:17.305
[Sa Hour: 9 AM to 11 AM]
I must enter the palace before Sa hour.

00:31:17.305 --> 00:31:18.372
Sa hour?

00:31:18.372 --> 00:31:22.105
His Majesty skips morning court
and takes breakfast at Sa hour.

00:31:22.105 --> 00:31:24.005
[Leegak: 30 mins]
He takes tonic broth half an hour after eating.

00:31:24.005 --> 00:31:25.472
We should head to the palace immediately.

00:31:25.472 --> 00:31:27.205
But Prince Je Woon is also in danger.

00:31:27.205 --> 00:31:29.305
If the exile destination's an island,
the Left Minister

00:31:29.305 --> 00:31:32.505
will eliminate Je Woon aboard that ship.

00:31:32.505 --> 00:31:34.338
That would be the cleanest.

00:31:34.338 --> 00:31:37.605
To take even the ruffians with us,
we cannot afford to split our manpower.

00:31:37.605 --> 00:31:40.805
Your Highness, you must choose.

00:32:06.505 --> 00:32:08.272
Is everything prepared?

00:32:08.272 --> 00:32:09.538
Yes.

00:32:09.538 --> 00:32:13.438
The ship carrying Prince Je Woon
will meet a storm and sink.

00:32:20.772 --> 00:32:23.405
This works better.

00:32:24.105 --> 00:32:25.693
There is neither

00:32:25.693 --> 00:32:29.305
the Crown Prince
nor Prince Je Woon with legitimate claim.

00:32:30.505 --> 00:32:34.105
If the king dies

00:32:34.105 --> 00:32:37.005
without an heir...

00:32:58.572 --> 00:33:00.405
Your Majesty!

00:33:07.972 --> 00:33:09.072
Your Majesty!

00:33:09.072 --> 00:33:12.705
The Crown Prince has returned.

00:33:12.705 --> 00:33:14.738
Bring him in immediately.

00:33:15.438 --> 00:33:17.972
Anyone could prevent Father's poisoning,

00:33:17.972 --> 00:33:21.505
[Jeongyo: Royal Edict]
but only His Majesty can revoke the exile.

00:33:22.605 --> 00:33:24.538
Only I can do this.

00:33:24.538 --> 00:33:26.872
This is headpiece I sent with the letter,

00:33:26.872 --> 00:33:29.405
proof that I'm still alive.

00:33:30.072 --> 00:33:31.938
You go to the palace.

00:33:46.538 --> 00:33:49.138
I'm going to Je Woon.

00:33:49.138 --> 00:33:50.738
Brother.

00:33:56.605 --> 00:33:59.485
Brother!

00:34:19.072 --> 00:34:22.805
Your Majesty, I have returned too late.

00:34:22.805 --> 00:34:25.505
For disturbing royal peace
and confusing the people,

00:34:25.505 --> 00:34:28.405
please punish my filial impiety and disloyalty.

00:34:28.405 --> 00:34:30.338
No.

00:34:30.338 --> 00:34:32.838
You've lived, and that is enough.

00:34:32.838 --> 00:34:35.138
That's all that matters.

00:34:35.138 --> 00:34:39.672
Though I faced mortal dangers returning,

00:34:39.672 --> 00:34:42.972
Prince Je Woon's help brought me safely to court.

00:34:42.972 --> 00:34:46.605
Please grant Prince Je Woon due honors.

00:34:46.605 --> 00:34:48.705
I shall do so.

00:34:51.638 --> 00:34:53.938
This wasn't coincidence.

00:34:53.938 --> 00:34:58.772
The Crown Prince perfectly
understood my desperation.

00:34:58.772 --> 00:35:04.172
He seemed oblivious, but he had
fully grasped the situation inside the palace.

00:35:04.805 --> 00:35:07.805
Right after Prince Je Woon left for exile,

00:35:07.805 --> 00:35:09.938
he had already predicted that
I would poison His Majesty,

00:35:09.938 --> 00:35:12.905
and he even remembered the exact time

00:35:12.905 --> 00:35:16.338
His Majesty takes his tonic broth.

00:35:17.805 --> 00:35:19.933
The Crown Prince

00:35:19.933 --> 00:35:22.172
is a tiger.

00:35:26.638 --> 00:35:28.572
The moment the Left Guard Officer entered,

00:35:28.572 --> 00:35:32.672
he immediately noticed
the arsenic on the tonic bowl.

00:35:33.905 --> 00:35:36.638
You must've told him, didn't you?

00:35:36.638 --> 00:35:38.772
Yes.

00:35:38.772 --> 00:35:43.738
It seems the Grand Queen Dowager's
luck is shining today.

00:35:43.738 --> 00:35:46.438
What will you do now?

00:35:46.438 --> 00:35:49.038
To stand against the Left Minister,

00:35:49.038 --> 00:35:51.572
we must have the Grand Royal Dowager's support.

00:35:51.572 --> 00:35:53.372
But Your Majesty,

00:35:53.372 --> 00:35:55.338
they tried to assassinate you.

00:35:55.338 --> 00:35:58.605
If you let this slide,
what's to stop them next time?

00:35:58.605 --> 00:36:01.338
Save this for your future use.

00:36:01.338 --> 00:36:03.172
When the Left Minister falls,

00:36:03.172 --> 00:36:07.805
you'll need your own weapon to keep
the Grand Queen Dowager from seizing power.

00:36:14.838 --> 00:36:16.672
Forgive me, brother.

00:36:16.672 --> 00:36:17.805
Why?

00:36:17.805 --> 00:36:20.972
This is the Chief Secretary's fault, not yours.

00:36:35.538 --> 00:36:39.005
Do you trust me, brother?

00:36:39.005 --> 00:36:42.405
What if I truly intended to kill you?

00:36:42.405 --> 00:36:44.972
Yes, I do.

00:36:44.972 --> 00:36:47.005
Because you're family.

00:36:50.738 --> 00:36:53.138
And I know the real culprit.

00:36:53.138 --> 00:36:55.805
I saw who shot at me on the cliff.

00:36:55.805 --> 00:36:57.672
What do you mean?

00:36:57.672 --> 00:36:59.672
The Left Minister's daughter.

00:37:01.438 --> 00:37:05.738
I'd be dead if not for Dal I.

00:37:06.938 --> 00:37:08.472
Dal I?

00:37:08.472 --> 00:37:11.305
Did you meet Dal I at Sinjusa Temple?

00:37:11.305 --> 00:37:12.938
Huh?

00:37:13.805 --> 00:37:15.872
How do you know that?

00:37:15.872 --> 00:37:17.938
That she went to Sinjusa Temple?

00:37:18.905 --> 00:37:19.905
I heard.

00:37:19.905 --> 00:37:22.172
She said she'd stop by before leaving.

00:37:24.438 --> 00:37:26.938
Ah, about Dal I.

00:37:26.938 --> 00:37:30.072
I told her to stay in Hanyang for a while,

00:37:30.072 --> 00:37:32.305
but she doesn't have anywhere to stay.

00:37:32.305 --> 00:37:34.305
Could she stay at your place temporarily?

00:37:34.305 --> 00:37:35.972
Is Dal I in Hanyang now?

00:37:35.972 --> 00:37:38.405
Yes, she's at the Hanyang Merchant Group.

00:37:38.405 --> 00:37:40.538
Why would you send her there?

00:37:40.538 --> 00:37:43.238
What if the Master Leader notices her?

00:37:43.238 --> 00:37:44.838
Why would that matter?

00:37:47.672 --> 00:37:49.272
Brother.

00:37:49.272 --> 00:37:52.338
The court ladies Her Majesty keeps
sending to Donggung Palace

00:37:52.338 --> 00:37:55.038
all came through the head of
Hanyang Merchant Group.

00:37:55.038 --> 00:37:56.805
And they say Dal I resembles
Her Highness, the Crown Princess.

00:37:56.805 --> 00:38:01.272
If the Queen Dowager learns Dal I saved our lives,

00:38:01.272 --> 00:38:03.805
do you think she'll let Dal I live?

00:38:07.938 --> 00:38:10.005
Hey, hey, hey.

00:38:10.005 --> 00:38:11.705
Go quickly!

00:38:11.705 --> 00:38:15.238
Bring Dal I back right now!

00:38:15.238 --> 00:38:18.305
Run, run faster!

00:38:24.972 --> 00:38:26.909
I heard you almost got exiled.

00:38:26.909 --> 00:38:29.472
Are you alright?

00:38:29.472 --> 00:38:30.805
As you can see, I'm fine.

00:38:30.805 --> 00:38:32.505
What a relief.

00:38:33.705 --> 00:38:37.172
And... is the secret inspector doing well?

00:38:37.172 --> 00:38:39.438
- Uh, he's...
- He was shot.

00:38:39.438 --> 00:38:41.738
The journey was rough, and he got into fights,

00:38:41.738 --> 00:38:43.838
so his wounds worsened.

00:38:43.838 --> 00:38:45.872
He lost a lot of blood.

00:38:45.872 --> 00:38:48.205
I doubt he received proper treatment.

00:38:48.205 --> 00:38:50.172
What about meals?

00:38:50.172 --> 00:38:51.605
Is he eating well?

00:38:51.605 --> 00:38:52.605
- Ugh.
- Ugh.

00:38:52.605 --> 00:38:55.705
His strength has really faded,
so he needs to eat well.

00:38:55.705 --> 00:38:58.905
To regain his strength, he needs to eat
everything without picking and choosing,

00:38:58.905 --> 00:39:01.805
but he looks like the kind who is a picky eater.

00:39:03.572 --> 00:39:06.872
Why haven't you answered yet?

00:39:07.772 --> 00:39:09.838
You've been bombarding me with questions,

00:39:09.838 --> 00:39:11.972
leaving me no time to respond.

00:39:11.972 --> 00:39:12.972
Did I do that?

00:39:12.972 --> 00:39:15.038
Goodness.

00:39:15.038 --> 00:39:17.672
Seems you've grown closer to him.

00:39:17.672 --> 00:39:21.138
The depth of your concern
for him surpasses that for me.

00:39:21.138 --> 00:39:22.172
It stings a bit.

00:39:22.172 --> 00:39:25.705
Oh, come on.

00:39:25.705 --> 00:39:27.705
It's because of the compensation money.

00:39:27.705 --> 00:39:30.672
He promised a hefty sum.

00:39:30.672 --> 00:39:35.572
I need to get that money, so I can pay off
your debt and all that, right?

00:39:35.572 --> 00:39:39.205
If that's your worry, don't fret.

00:39:40.572 --> 00:39:43.605
All of that is yours.

00:39:54.572 --> 00:39:56.172
Everything...

00:40:07.305 --> 00:40:10.138
What will happen to me now?

00:40:11.672 --> 00:40:14.072
The Crown Prince has returned.

00:40:14.938 --> 00:40:17.738
Nothing will change.

00:40:17.738 --> 00:40:21.472
Even if the Crown Prince
or His Majesty dies again,

00:40:21.472 --> 00:40:24.305
nothing will change.

00:40:25.972 --> 00:40:29.338
You will take the seat I've prepared.

00:40:30.672 --> 00:40:34.938
As you said, I have no other choice but you.

00:40:34.938 --> 00:40:37.705
But the throne is different.

00:40:37.705 --> 00:40:39.005
If His Majesty dies,

00:40:39.005 --> 00:40:43.005
another royal relative will take his place.

00:40:43.005 --> 00:40:47.438
Then why can't it be Prince Je Woon?

00:40:48.272 --> 00:40:50.705
Because he's the late king's son.

00:40:51.772 --> 00:40:54.738
And the son of Queen Jangjeong.

00:41:04.672 --> 00:41:07.438
If you fear he'll seek revenge,
that worry is groundless.

00:41:07.438 --> 00:41:10.472
Prince Je Woon even tried to
take my crime upon himself.

00:41:10.472 --> 00:41:13.105
And now the biggest reason is

00:41:13.738 --> 00:41:15.672
you.

00:41:15.672 --> 00:41:20.672
What evidence do you have that
Prince Je Woon won't seek revenge on me?

00:41:20.672 --> 00:41:23.705
Your affection for him, is it not?

00:41:23.705 --> 00:41:26.972
You killed the Crown Prince for Prince Je Woon,

00:41:26.972 --> 00:41:30.605
and Prince Je Woon sacrificed his life for you.

00:41:30.605 --> 00:41:34.638
Such affection makes us vulnerable.

00:41:34.638 --> 00:41:37.772
There's no guarantee you won't be
swayed by Prince Je Woon

00:41:37.772 --> 00:41:40.972
and turn against me.

00:41:41.972 --> 00:41:45.638
So now, wake up

00:41:47.205 --> 00:41:48.838
from this empty dream.

00:42:01.438 --> 00:42:03.272
Wait, she sent all these back?

00:42:03.272 --> 00:42:04.638
Why?

00:42:04.638 --> 00:42:06.238
Well,

00:42:07.538 --> 00:42:12.205
they say she returned everything
except her travel expenses to Hanyang.

00:42:12.205 --> 00:42:14.938
What kind of merchant is that? Huh?

00:42:14.938 --> 00:42:16.938
She seems like proper merchants to me.

00:42:16.938 --> 00:42:18.972
She only took the silver pieces here.

00:42:18.972 --> 00:42:21.205
Her accounting is perfectly precise.

00:42:21.205 --> 00:42:23.905
What shall we do with all these?

00:42:24.838 --> 00:42:26.493
Then

00:42:26.493 --> 00:42:29.838
prepare a box with as many small
and expensive items as possible, understood?

00:42:29.838 --> 00:42:31.572
Make sure it doesn't look burdensome, okay?

00:42:31.572 --> 00:42:33.172
Yes.

00:42:40.805 --> 00:42:42.405
Wait.

00:42:43.038 --> 00:42:44.638
Yes?

00:42:45.372 --> 00:42:50.405
Inspector said he'd really like you
to wear this outfit when you come out.

00:43:12.472 --> 00:43:15.605
'You thought you could buy
my favor with something like this?'

00:43:17.238 --> 00:43:19.172
I knew you'd act like this.

00:43:19.172 --> 00:43:22.238
I never imagined you'd be moved
so much by a single dress.

00:43:22.238 --> 00:43:26.305
Something so beautiful isn't 'just a dress.'

00:43:30.638 --> 00:43:33.338
A nobody like me would be punished for

00:43:33.338 --> 00:43:34.805
wearing something like this.

00:43:34.805 --> 00:43:37.505
If you don't wear that garment,
you'll be punished.

00:43:37.505 --> 00:43:39.572
You may not realize it, but you

00:43:39.572 --> 00:43:42.038
have accomplished something extraordinary.

00:43:42.672 --> 00:43:48.105
When you find out later, you'll regret
having settled it all with just one dress.

00:43:50.338 --> 00:43:51.572
Put them on and come out.

00:43:51.572 --> 00:43:53.672
I'll see if they suit you well.

00:44:04.005 --> 00:44:05.541
What now?

00:44:06.141 --> 00:44:07.572
Huh?

00:44:09.705 --> 00:44:12.138
No wonder I feel so glad.

00:44:12.938 --> 00:44:15.805
You even recognize me
by the sound of my footsteps.

00:44:16.572 --> 00:44:20.638
Too much has been broken
between us for such words.

00:44:20.638 --> 00:44:23.438
This is to restore things to their rightful place.

00:44:32.538 --> 00:44:36.105
Why do you always climb high places?

00:44:36.105 --> 00:44:40.172
Because Queen Mother is in heaven.

00:44:40.172 --> 00:44:42.045
Do you

00:44:42.045 --> 00:44:43.838
miss your mother?

00:44:45.105 --> 00:44:48.637
Is that your...

00:44:48.637 --> 00:44:50.705
dream?

00:44:50.705 --> 00:44:52.638
My dream is

00:44:54.605 --> 00:44:57.341
to return

00:44:57.341 --> 00:44:58.772
to the past.

00:44:58.772 --> 00:45:00.405
You surely didn't

00:45:01.138 --> 00:45:03.572
do all this because of something I said?

00:45:03.572 --> 00:45:06.505
Not once have I forgotten your dream.

00:45:06.505 --> 00:45:08.413
Thus

00:45:08.413 --> 00:45:09.672
it became my dream.

00:45:09.672 --> 00:45:11.538
Since it can't be achieved, it remains a dream.

00:45:11.538 --> 00:45:13.349
You should

00:45:14.141 --> 00:45:16.238
wake up from that dream too.

00:45:20.138 --> 00:45:22.672
I'm not sure if this is right.

00:45:22.672 --> 00:45:24.472
I mean, wearing something like this.

00:45:32.072 --> 00:45:33.821
It seems

00:45:33.821 --> 00:45:35.905
you have a visitor.

00:45:45.038 --> 00:45:47.005
Not a visitor,

00:45:47.005 --> 00:45:49.072
but my woman.

00:45:49.072 --> 00:45:52.038
The woman who will build a family with me.

00:45:52.038 --> 00:45:54.438
So, could you please leave now?

00:45:54.438 --> 00:45:57.872
As you see, I have plans.

00:46:01.972 --> 00:46:04.572
I haven't torn up the contract yet.

00:46:16.005 --> 00:46:17.805
Stop.

00:46:30.672 --> 00:46:33.772
You seem to be under some misunderstanding.

00:46:33.772 --> 00:46:37.005
You're not in a position to command me.

00:46:37.005 --> 00:46:38.905
A mere gentry woman

00:46:38.905 --> 00:46:41.272
cannot command a royal relative.

00:46:41.272 --> 00:46:43.581
The only reason

00:46:43.581 --> 00:46:46.557
I followed your words until now was love,

00:46:46.557 --> 00:46:48.305
and

00:46:52.072 --> 00:46:54.538
the one who loved you

00:46:57.738 --> 00:46:59.405
is dead now.

00:47:20.638 --> 00:47:22.238
I'm sorry.

00:47:22.972 --> 00:47:24.872
Are you alright?

00:47:25.672 --> 00:47:27.538
Well enough.

00:47:27.538 --> 00:47:29.905
You come first, right?

00:47:29.905 --> 00:47:34.605
Before Inspector
and the Left Minister's daughter, right?

00:47:36.272 --> 00:47:37.853
Now,

00:47:37.853 --> 00:47:40.772
what does order matter anymore?

00:47:41.438 --> 00:47:43.538
Why don't you go to her?

00:47:45.238 --> 00:47:47.105
To save lives.

00:47:48.205 --> 00:47:50.772
For her and me,

00:47:50.772 --> 00:47:54.572
this is the only way to survive.

00:47:54.572 --> 00:47:56.125
So

00:47:56.861 --> 00:47:59.305
will you help me?

00:48:00.772 --> 00:48:04.438
I still have your contract, you know?

00:48:06.138 --> 00:48:07.972
Yes.

00:48:07.972 --> 00:48:10.672
A debtor like me has no power.

00:48:10.672 --> 00:48:12.305
I must follow.

00:48:39.072 --> 00:48:42.405
Your Highness, you look cheerful.

00:48:44.605 --> 00:48:46.838
Cheerful, you say?

00:48:47.638 --> 00:48:49.205
A true gentleman finds

00:48:49.205 --> 00:48:53.372
great joy in repaying kindness
and practicing virtue.

00:48:53.372 --> 00:48:56.505
Or something like that.

00:48:56.505 --> 00:48:58.872
I hope your heart is truly that of a gentleman.

00:48:58.872 --> 00:49:00.838
You'll soon have a royal marriage.

00:49:00.838 --> 00:49:02.305
If people see a woman around Your Highness...

00:49:02.305 --> 00:49:04.872
Especially one who resembles
the deposed Crown Princess,

00:49:04.872 --> 00:49:08.472
not only would the porter be in danger,

00:49:08.472 --> 00:49:12.438
but the Left Minister's surveillance
of Your Highness would intensify.

00:49:12.438 --> 00:49:16.072
It's simply a repayment to the one
who saved my life, nothing more.

00:49:16.072 --> 00:49:18.172
So this is the last time.

00:49:21.772 --> 00:49:23.372
Today...

00:49:25.638 --> 00:49:28.138
Today is the very last.

00:49:28.138 --> 00:49:30.705
Oh, my. So beautiful.

00:49:53.572 --> 00:49:55.272
My lord!

00:49:59.405 --> 00:50:01.105
Again, again, again.

00:50:01.105 --> 00:50:03.905
That radiant smile again.

00:50:19.805 --> 00:50:20.838
Wow.

00:50:20.838 --> 00:50:23.272
This is it!

00:50:24.405 --> 00:50:27.972
Why does this simple rice soup move you more

00:50:27.972 --> 00:50:30.038
than all the treasures I sent you?

00:50:30.038 --> 00:50:32.205
This isn't just ordinary rice soup.

00:50:32.205 --> 00:50:35.872
This rice soup saved my leg and your life too.

00:50:41.338 --> 00:50:43.238
Truly,

00:50:43.238 --> 00:50:45.245
it is

00:50:45.245 --> 00:50:47.638
a remarkable bowl of rice soup.

00:50:50.472 --> 00:50:52.905
Now that we've had the rice soup,

00:50:53.772 --> 00:50:56.372
it's truly goodbye to you.

00:50:56.372 --> 00:50:58.005
Already?

00:51:01.272 --> 00:51:03.972
I hear there's a firework show later.

00:51:03.972 --> 00:51:08.538
Why not watch it before leaving?

00:51:08.538 --> 00:51:10.338
- A firework show?
- Yes.

00:51:10.338 --> 00:51:14.872
They say the fireworks are in honor
of His Highness, the Crown Prince,

00:51:14.872 --> 00:51:16.541
who recently went missing

00:51:16.541 --> 00:51:18.372
but returned safely.

00:51:21.738 --> 00:51:22.972
I'm fine.

00:51:22.972 --> 00:51:25.072
I've seen firework show all over the provinces.

00:51:25.072 --> 00:51:26.705
Even so,

00:51:26.705 --> 00:51:28.669
it'll be

00:51:28.669 --> 00:51:30.749
your first time seeing firework show

00:51:30.749 --> 00:51:32.605
in Hanyang, right?

00:51:41.372 --> 00:51:42.872
Alright.

00:51:42.872 --> 00:51:45.705
Let's watch the firework show together.

00:51:53.005 --> 00:51:56.838
Ah, this is it.

00:52:14.672 --> 00:52:16.405
Wait a moment.

00:52:17.805 --> 00:52:20.838
Oh, no. My heel's blistered.

00:52:20.838 --> 00:52:23.105
I'm not used to wearing these.

00:52:23.105 --> 00:52:25.805
You wait over there.

00:52:25.805 --> 00:52:26.805
Where are you going?

00:52:26.805 --> 00:52:28.638
It won't take long.

00:52:28.638 --> 00:52:32.805
Shin Won and I will go together.
Se Dol, you stay here and keep watch, got it?

00:52:32.805 --> 00:52:34.405
My lord.

00:52:37.138 --> 00:52:39.238
What's this about?

00:52:41.838 --> 00:52:46.372
Where can I get shoes that
suit the autumn leaf type?

00:52:46.372 --> 00:52:51.005
She probably won't wear them
more than once, so just pick something simple.

00:52:54.172 --> 00:52:57.672
It's my last pair of shoes for her,
so I need to pick carefully.

00:52:57.672 --> 00:53:00.672
A really pretty pair.

00:53:01.805 --> 00:53:04.305
Why are you so heartless?

00:53:07.572 --> 00:53:10.405
Ugh, it's driving me crazy.

00:53:12.305 --> 00:53:14.972
What's wrong? You're twitching
like a dog that needs to poop.

00:53:14.972 --> 00:53:16.105
No!

00:53:16.105 --> 00:53:21.205
Don't mention poop or dogs in front of me.

00:53:21.205 --> 00:53:22.738
Fine, fine.

00:53:22.738 --> 00:53:24.572
You startled me.

00:53:24.572 --> 00:53:25.638
Excuse me for a moment.

00:53:25.638 --> 00:53:27.438
Huh? What?

00:53:28.905 --> 00:53:31.472
Why are they all acting like that?

00:53:51.072 --> 00:53:52.838
Wait, wait.

00:53:55.238 --> 00:53:59.505
That woman... looks familiar.

00:54:00.472 --> 00:54:04.872
Ah, a true beauty is unforgettable
at first sight, right?

00:54:04.872 --> 00:54:07.872
How elegant... huh?

00:54:07.872 --> 00:54:09.838
Is that the porter?

00:54:09.838 --> 00:54:11.172
Porter?

00:54:11.172 --> 00:54:13.872
Yes, our lady master...

00:54:13.872 --> 00:54:16.105
No, actually...

00:54:16.105 --> 00:54:18.838
She's the wench who ruined
Minister Ji Pyeong's household.

00:54:18.838 --> 00:54:19.938
I'm certain.

00:54:19.938 --> 00:54:21.538
Is that so?

00:54:31.205 --> 00:54:32.505
It's been a while.

00:54:32.505 --> 00:54:33.538
You are...

00:54:33.538 --> 00:54:36.938
Minister Lee requests your presence.

00:54:36.938 --> 00:54:38.538
You!

00:54:40.538 --> 00:54:43.905
How dare a lowly merchant

00:54:43.905 --> 00:54:48.338
wear red silk reserved for nobles.

00:54:48.338 --> 00:54:51.105
Do you think you can remain unpunished

00:54:51.105 --> 00:54:52.572
after disturbing the moral order?

00:54:52.572 --> 00:54:54.072
My deepest apologies.

00:54:54.072 --> 00:54:58.072
Give me a moment. I'll change clothes immediately.

00:54:58.072 --> 00:55:00.538
Do you think changing clothes

00:55:00.538 --> 00:55:04.838
will solve your crime?

00:55:04.838 --> 00:55:09.372
I could execute you now

00:55:09.372 --> 00:55:11.905
for violating social order.

00:55:11.905 --> 00:55:13.338
I've committed a grave sin.

00:55:13.338 --> 00:55:16.605
Spare me once, and I'll do anything.

00:55:16.605 --> 00:55:18.672
Just spare my life.

00:55:21.905 --> 00:55:24.905
Exactly.

00:55:25.638 --> 00:55:30.005
'Anything' indeed.

00:55:34.938 --> 00:55:38.172
Ah, Minister Lee, what a troublemaker.

00:55:39.538 --> 00:55:42.605
Your Highness, Your Highness.

00:55:43.605 --> 00:55:44.905
Your Highness, Your Highness.

00:55:44.905 --> 00:55:48.038
I told you to guard her. Why are you here?

00:55:48.038 --> 00:55:49.738
What? Why? Why? Why?

00:55:49.738 --> 00:55:51.205
Just tell me!

00:55:51.205 --> 00:55:53.205
Your Highness, urgh!

00:56:08.638 --> 00:56:10.972
Ah, poor merchant.

00:56:10.972 --> 00:56:12.805
How did she end up caught by the Minister?

00:56:12.805 --> 00:56:16.638
I mean, why did she wear red silk
that doesn't match her station?

00:56:18.705 --> 00:56:20.338
Merchant in red silk.

00:56:20.338 --> 00:56:22.205
Isn't that the porter earlier?

00:56:22.205 --> 00:56:23.772
How long have you been following me?

00:56:23.772 --> 00:56:26.638
From earlier all along.

00:56:26.638 --> 00:56:28.838
Now that you've been spotted, go back.

00:56:28.838 --> 00:56:30.672
I have somewhere to be.

00:56:34.772 --> 00:56:37.272
Minister Lee is my father's closest ally.

00:56:37.272 --> 00:56:40.072
Stop being a thorn in my father's eye.

00:56:40.805 --> 00:56:42.405
Let go.

00:56:44.338 --> 00:56:48.205
Are you truly planning to form a family
with some lowly porter?

00:56:53.705 --> 00:56:55.572
Why not?

00:56:55.572 --> 00:56:57.917
I wanted to build a family

00:56:57.917 --> 00:56:59.838
with you too.

00:57:08.605 --> 00:57:10.238
Huh?

00:57:11.772 --> 00:57:14.238
Now come with me.

00:57:25.272 --> 00:57:27.672
No, wait. Why here?

00:57:27.672 --> 00:57:30.038
Let's go home, okay?

00:57:32.138 --> 00:57:34.938
Ah, what madness...

00:57:34.938 --> 00:57:38.972
I've torn off the noble's fine clothes.

00:57:38.972 --> 00:57:43.305
Do you intend to pick up the sins
I've dropped to the ground and punish me?

00:57:43.305 --> 00:57:45.805
How could a Minister of Personnel threaten

00:57:45.805 --> 00:57:50.038
and molest a woman against the laws of rank?

00:57:50.038 --> 00:57:51.872
Is it right that a man like you

00:57:51.872 --> 00:57:55.338
sits high in the court and speaks of governance?

00:57:55.338 --> 00:57:57.672
You crazy...

00:57:57.672 --> 00:58:01.605
You clearly value your life little!

00:58:02.305 --> 00:58:04.505
I'll kill you instantly!

00:58:09.472 --> 00:58:11.305
How dare you...

00:58:12.172 --> 00:58:14.472
How dare someone like you...

00:58:15.438 --> 00:58:16.772
My lord. This is going to get you into trouble.

00:58:16.772 --> 00:58:19.472
Sheathe your sword.

00:58:27.138 --> 00:58:29.972
Your Highness the Crown Prince.

00:58:32.505 --> 00:58:35.338
'Your Highness,' you say?

00:58:44.038 --> 00:58:47.038
Step aside. Move.

00:58:47.038 --> 00:58:49.872
I don't know where to begin.

00:58:49.872 --> 00:58:53.972
How long are you going to keep
running around like a madman?

00:58:53.972 --> 00:58:55.938
No, I was just...

00:58:55.938 --> 00:58:57.572
Why won't you wait?

00:58:57.572 --> 00:59:01.305
When in danger, hurt, or fallen,
you should pause and wait.

00:59:01.305 --> 00:59:02.905
You should've cried for help.

00:59:02.905 --> 00:59:06.238
You should've waited until I resolved it.

00:59:06.238 --> 00:59:08.272
Why should I wait for you...

00:59:08.272 --> 00:59:10.172
No...

00:59:10.172 --> 00:59:12.125
Why should I

00:59:12.125 --> 00:59:14.905
wait for Your Highness?

00:59:14.905 --> 00:59:16.733
Why

00:59:16.733 --> 00:59:18.372
should Your Highness solve my problem?

00:59:18.372 --> 00:59:20.505
This isn't just your problem!

00:59:22.072 --> 00:59:24.538
Do you think it's only your problem?

00:59:24.538 --> 00:59:28.605
I clearly stated your face resembles my wife's.

00:59:32.005 --> 00:59:36.205
Is that why you wanted me

00:59:37.205 --> 00:59:39.938
to wear that dress?

00:59:39.938 --> 00:59:44.138
Did you use that as an excuse
to toy with me and take me for your wife...

00:59:44.138 --> 00:59:46.205
no,

00:59:46.205 --> 00:59:50.905
Her Highness the Crown Princess?

00:59:50.905 --> 00:59:52.538
What?

00:59:54.905 --> 00:59:57.105
Will you keep speaking so recklessly?

00:59:57.105 --> 00:59:59.672
Isn't that why Your Highness is angry?

00:59:59.672 --> 01:00:01.872
This lowborn wretch

01:00:03.538 --> 01:00:06.272
should resemble Her Highness the Crown Princess.

01:00:06.272 --> 01:00:10.472
Isn't it because I, who resemble your wife,
was being humiliated?

01:00:15.072 --> 01:00:16.797
True,

01:00:16.797 --> 01:00:18.038
you're correct.

01:00:18.038 --> 01:00:21.538
If you get it, don't rush
into danger with that face.

01:00:21.538 --> 01:00:24.138
Don't step up, and don't let anyone humiliate you!

01:00:29.238 --> 01:00:31.972
I know well you're not my wife.

01:00:31.972 --> 01:00:34.205
I'll neither confuse nor waver again.

01:00:34.205 --> 01:00:37.472
So take this and never appear before me again.

01:00:54.338 --> 01:00:56.405
What are you doing now?

01:00:56.405 --> 01:00:58.838
This is mine now, right?

01:00:59.538 --> 01:01:01.021
So

01:01:01.021 --> 01:01:03.338
I will do as I please.

01:01:09.405 --> 01:01:11.105
Stop.

01:01:11.105 --> 01:01:12.738
It's an order.

01:01:17.572 --> 01:01:20.738
What are you doing now?

01:01:20.738 --> 01:01:24.305
How dare you throw away a gift
from His Highness on the ground?

01:01:24.305 --> 01:01:27.205
This is treason and impiety.

01:01:27.205 --> 01:01:31.472
Will Your Highness leave this traitor unpunished?

01:01:31.472 --> 01:01:33.005
Lower your sword.

01:01:33.005 --> 01:01:36.572
If you intervene, things will
get worse, Prince Je Woon.

01:01:42.938 --> 01:01:44.572
I beg you.

01:01:45.905 --> 01:01:47.972
Please stop this.

01:01:47.972 --> 01:01:49.882
The bloodshed

01:01:49.882 --> 01:01:52.338
is because of you.

01:02:36.172 --> 01:02:39.205
Your Highness, Your Highness.

01:02:39.205 --> 01:02:40.573
I am wronged.

01:02:40.573 --> 01:02:42.909
All this is the Left Minister's fabrication.

01:02:42.909 --> 01:02:47.938
The Left Minister sent his daughter
to bring me down. This was his plan.

01:02:47.938 --> 01:02:50.538
The Left Minister's daughter...

01:02:50.538 --> 01:02:52.285
So

01:02:52.285 --> 01:02:54.905
what did that woman say?

01:02:54.905 --> 01:02:59.605
She demanded to be Crown Princess
if Prince Je Woon ascends.

01:02:59.605 --> 01:03:02.872
She claimed she had attempted
to assassinate Your Highness...

01:03:02.872 --> 01:03:06.205
that you would never return.

01:03:06.205 --> 01:03:07.805
Did you

01:03:07.805 --> 01:03:09.238
tell anyone that?

01:03:09.238 --> 01:03:11.472
Never spoke of it in detail.

01:03:11.472 --> 01:03:14.005
Then, silence those mouths.

01:03:14.005 --> 01:03:17.038
Neither Prince Je Woon
nor the Left Minister's daughter

01:03:17.038 --> 01:03:19.172
shall be mentioned again.

01:03:24.538 --> 01:03:27.272
If you value your life.

01:03:58.772 --> 01:04:00.405
Oh.

01:04:01.438 --> 01:04:03.038
My lord.

01:04:05.772 --> 01:04:10.605
The neck wound appears shallow,

01:04:10.605 --> 01:04:14.572
but the heart's wound runs deep.

01:04:18.038 --> 01:04:19.938
I'm fine.

01:04:21.305 --> 01:04:25.105
My greed broke the carrier.

01:04:25.105 --> 01:04:27.905
I tried carrying more salt than frame could bear.

01:04:27.905 --> 01:04:31.338
What frame wouldn't break under such load?

01:04:33.272 --> 01:04:37.872
Just some silk robes and embroidered shoes.

01:04:37.872 --> 01:04:40.672
What frame couldn't carry that?

01:04:44.672 --> 01:04:47.372
Someone must've broken it.

01:04:48.172 --> 01:04:49.905
No, it's not.

01:04:49.905 --> 01:04:53.005
No wonder my happiness seemed misplaced.

01:04:53.005 --> 01:04:56.305
Things like this just weren't meant for me.

01:04:56.305 --> 01:04:58.738
Flower shoes? Darn it.

01:04:58.738 --> 01:05:01.072
They even hurt my feet.

01:05:01.072 --> 01:05:02.661
Then

01:05:03.485 --> 01:05:05.638
these should be fine, right?

01:05:08.538 --> 01:05:10.772
Oh, I could do it myself.

01:05:12.172 --> 01:05:16.038
These straw shoes were hastily
bought on my way here.

01:05:16.038 --> 01:05:19.038
It's not that flower shoes don't suit you.

01:05:22.605 --> 01:05:26.072
Why did you threaten only the Chief Secretary?

01:05:26.072 --> 01:05:28.005
You know the real culprit, right?

01:05:28.005 --> 01:05:30.305
Because I've figured out the reason.

01:05:38.505 --> 01:05:41.172
Just go, all of you.

01:05:41.838 --> 01:05:44.672
You're all disloyal subjects.

01:05:51.772 --> 01:05:54.272
I shall take my leave now.

01:05:54.272 --> 01:05:56.772
My beloved seems injured.

01:05:58.705 --> 01:06:01.505
Now there are only those holding blades

01:06:01.505 --> 01:06:05.138
at the tips of their fingers or tongues.

01:06:32.738 --> 01:06:36.872
Sometimes, a touch

01:06:36.872 --> 01:06:40.638
or a glance carries
the truest intention and answer.

01:06:43.205 --> 01:06:46.138
My own vengeance also began from affection.

01:06:46.138 --> 01:06:50.505
If I crush Prince Je Woon's feelings
for my revenge,

01:06:50.505 --> 01:06:53.038
I'll only leave another wound in the heart.

01:06:53.038 --> 01:06:54.638
However...

01:06:57.738 --> 01:06:59.638
Rather than searching for the Zhen bird,

01:06:59.638 --> 01:07:04.305
wouldn't finding evidence that the Left Minister's
daughter tried to assassinate you be faster?

01:07:04.305 --> 01:07:07.038
Vengeance is never too late,
no matter how delayed.

01:07:07.038 --> 01:07:11.405
Choosing the righteous path
matters more than speed.

01:07:15.638 --> 01:07:17.905
But that's a bit too much, isn't it?

01:07:23.672 --> 01:07:24.838
Your Highness.

01:07:24.838 --> 01:07:28.138
Please calm yourself and return to the palace...

01:07:28.138 --> 01:07:32.172
How could such emotions calm so quickly?

01:07:32.172 --> 01:07:33.172
Those emotions?

01:07:33.172 --> 01:07:34.438
You must feel uneasy.

01:07:34.438 --> 01:07:36.172
You were confronted in front of many people...

01:07:36.172 --> 01:07:37.372
That's not the feeling.

01:07:37.372 --> 01:07:39.205
Yes, it is.

01:07:39.205 --> 01:07:41.438
Se Dol, you finally said something
correct after a long time.

01:07:41.438 --> 01:07:44.005
Oh, really?

01:07:44.005 --> 01:07:46.672
I'm utterly furious now.

01:07:46.672 --> 01:07:50.772
If I'm never to see that girl again,

01:07:50.772 --> 01:07:54.372
I'll have no way to release
this bitterness, if not now...

01:07:54.372 --> 01:07:56.372
That's why I'm going.

01:07:56.372 --> 01:07:58.872
To resolve this anger.

01:08:03.372 --> 01:08:04.838
Let's go.

01:08:04.838 --> 01:08:08.138
First aid is done, so now
we must go for proper treatment.

01:08:15.038 --> 01:08:16.838
Change into these clothes.

01:08:18.005 --> 01:08:21.472
What? You haven't left yet?

01:08:21.472 --> 01:08:24.138
That outfit you're wearing,

01:08:24.138 --> 01:08:26.205
that harsh blue clashes with you.

01:08:26.205 --> 01:08:28.805
Because you're an autumn leaf type.

01:08:28.805 --> 01:08:32.005
Anyway, this color suits
you better. Change quickly.

01:08:32.005 --> 01:08:33.872
Did you follow me because of the clothes?

01:08:33.872 --> 01:08:35.838
Following you?

01:08:35.838 --> 01:08:39.705
I passed by, saw you, stopped,
and then realized...

01:08:43.405 --> 01:08:45.072
My feelings.

01:08:53.238 --> 01:08:54.838
Alright.

01:08:56.905 --> 01:08:58.605
Thank you.

01:08:59.405 --> 01:09:01.338
Let's hear what you have to say.

01:09:11.438 --> 01:09:12.893
Now,

01:09:12.893 --> 01:09:14.272
tell me.

01:09:14.272 --> 01:09:16.638
What exactly is that 'feeling'?

01:09:21.772 --> 01:09:23.438
Infuriating.

01:09:24.605 --> 01:09:27.105
They say the one who caused it
is the one getting mad.

01:09:27.105 --> 01:09:29.205
Alright.

01:09:29.205 --> 01:09:31.638
Why exactly is Your Highness angry?

01:09:31.638 --> 01:09:34.672
I never used you as a puppet
replacing the Crown Princess.

01:09:34.672 --> 01:09:36.438
It enrages me to be seen as shameless,

01:09:36.438 --> 01:09:39.872
when I'm being misunderstood
for feelings I never had.

01:09:40.605 --> 01:09:42.905
That's not it.

01:09:42.905 --> 01:09:44.605
In this case,

01:09:46.038 --> 01:09:49.072
you should apologize.

01:09:49.072 --> 01:09:52.238
Admit your wrongdoing.

01:09:52.238 --> 01:09:54.738
You want me, the Crown Prince, to apologize?

01:09:54.738 --> 01:09:57.005
Admit fault and beg for forgiveness?

01:09:57.005 --> 01:09:59.805
To a mere porter?

01:09:59.805 --> 01:10:03.672
If you've done wrong,
apologizing is the right thing to do.

01:10:03.672 --> 01:10:08.205
Don't you know stubborn pride
brings more shame than bowed heads?

01:10:08.205 --> 01:10:10.813
No people will love

01:10:10.813 --> 01:10:13.638
a royal family that does not love the people.

01:10:15.172 --> 01:10:18.772
Hence, fear your people.

01:10:18.772 --> 01:10:21.072
Love them first.

01:10:21.072 --> 01:10:22.717
You rule

01:10:22.717 --> 01:10:25.438
not through dominance, but reason.

01:10:32.772 --> 01:10:35.038
Since you've nothing more to say,

01:10:35.038 --> 01:10:37.272
I'll take my leave.

01:10:54.972 --> 01:11:01.172
♫ You flew in like a cloud ♫

01:11:03.738 --> 01:11:09.905
♫ Departing like starlight, my beloved ♫

01:11:12.538 --> 01:11:17.205
♫ Oh, will my love return to me ♫

01:11:17.205 --> 01:11:20.172
Your marriage proposal has been submitted.

01:11:20.172 --> 01:11:23.805
In three months, you'll be Crown Princess.

01:11:23.805 --> 01:11:31.272
♫ Oh, how futile all becomes ♫

01:11:31.272 --> 01:11:33.972
♫ All but a dream ♫

01:11:43.505 --> 01:11:44.772
What are you doing now?

01:11:44.772 --> 01:11:46.872
What are you...

01:11:47.938 --> 01:11:50.338
What on earth are you...

01:11:51.638 --> 01:11:56.638
Why do you keep me here
when this is supposed to be our last time?

01:11:58.338 --> 01:12:01.405
Why do you root yourself in my heart again!

01:12:01.405 --> 01:12:07.038
♫ Oh, will my love return to me ♫

01:12:07.038 --> 01:12:15.805
♫ Oh, how futile all becomes ♫

01:12:15.805 --> 01:12:20.238
♫ Born of dreams, living and dying in dreams ♫

01:12:20.238 --> 01:12:23.438
♫ It's all for naught ♫

01:12:24.605 --> 01:12:33.938
♫ What use is dreaming such dreams ♫

01:12:33.938 --> 01:12:42.505
♫ Oh dear, oh dear, what a mess ♫

01:12:42.505 --> 01:12:51.305
♫ Oh dear, oh dear, what a mess ♫

01:12:51.305 --> 01:13:00.138
♫ Oh dear, oh dear, what a mess ♫

01:13:00.138 --> 01:13:08.905
♫ Oh dear, oh dear, what a mess ♫

01:13:08.905 --> 01:13:17.338
♫ Oh, will my love return to me ♫

01:13:17.338 --> 01:13:26.672
♫ Oh, how futile all becomes ♫

01:13:27.572 --> 01:13:30.572
♫ All but a dream ♫

01:15:21.172 --> 01:15:24.905
When you think about it,
swallows don't only repay kindness.

01:15:27.272 --> 01:15:29.538
They give blessings to Heungbu,

01:15:29.538 --> 01:15:32.138
and punishment to Nolbu.

01:15:32.138 --> 01:15:34.605
They're just shrewd merchants balancing accounts.

01:15:34.605 --> 01:15:37.905
That darn swallow must've made a mistake.

01:15:37.905 --> 01:15:41.505
No, someone as kind as me
couldn't possibly be Nolbu, right?

01:15:41.505 --> 01:15:44.205
- I, the precious Crown Prince...
- Why is this missing?

01:15:44.205 --> 01:15:47.605
Switched bodies with this lowly porter...

01:15:52.405 --> 01:15:55.005
It's divine punishment!

01:16:14.938 --> 01:16:16.805
His Highness has been
acting strange lately, right?

01:16:16.805 --> 01:16:22.272
I am Lee Gang Dol, Your Highness.

01:16:22.272 --> 01:16:24.338
What exactly is happening?

01:16:24.338 --> 01:16:26.838
Why don't we try it like we did that day?

01:16:26.838 --> 01:16:28.905
You mean kissing?

01:16:28.905 --> 01:16:31.372
If the Left Minister sees that face
resembling the Crown Princess...

01:16:31.372 --> 01:16:33.172
Then what would happen?

01:16:33.172 --> 01:16:34.972
He'll kill her, of course.